{{also|mittel}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|mittel}}, from {{inh|de|goh|mittil}} (akin to Old Saxon {{m|osx|middil}}), from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*midlą}}, {{m|gem-pro|*midilą}}, {{m|gem-pro|*medalą||middle}}, {{m|gem-pro|*midil-}}. Compare {{cog|nl|middel}}, {{cog|en|middle}}. See also {{m|de|Mitte}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈmɪtəl/|[ˈmɪtl̩]}}
* {{audio|de|De-Mittel.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n||Mittel}}

# [[agent]], [[appliance]]
